=== Model Estimation Script Ready ===

Key functions:
  - prepare_data_for_dfm() - Format data for nowcasting package
  - configure_dfm() - Set model parameters
  - estimate_dfm() - Run EM algorithm to estimate model
  - check_model_diagnostics() - Validate model quality
  - save_model() / load_model() - Persist models
  - run_model_estimation() - Complete workflow

